  "<strong>I rode this cruise myself.</strong> Most of the photos in the review are my own, and so is the video.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">What I checked: deck views, commentary, drinks and value for money. <a href=\"#cruise-1-legenda\">Full review ↓</a></span>": {
   "source": "listicle file best-budapest-river-cruises/he.json",
   "seen": 1
  },
  "<strong>Until 22 November:</strong> daytime cruises at 11:00, 12:30, 14:00 and 15:30; evening cruises every 20 minutes from 16:20 to 21:00. About 1 hour.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\"><b>📍 Vigadó tér, Dock 7:</b> Pest side, 2 minutes from Vörösmarty tér and the top of Váci utca. Covered floating dock with restrooms and a rooftop waiting area.</span>": {
   "source": "listicle file best-budapest-river-cruises/he.json",
   "seen": 1
  },
  "30-Lang Audio": {
   "source": "listicle file best-budapest-river-cruises/he.json",
   "seen": 1
  },
  "<strong>Audio languages:</strong> <span class=\"bpa-lang-names\">English, Hungarian, German, Italian, French, Spanish, Portuguese, Dutch, Danish, Swedish, Norwegian, Finnish, Estonian, Latvian, Lithuanian, Polish, Czech, Slovak, Slovenian, Croatian, Romanian, Greek, Turkish, Russian, Hebrew, Arabic, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Thai</span><span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">Film and audio guide on headsets Legenda hands out, so no earphones needed. From the language list on legenda.hu.</span>": {
   "source": "listicle file best-budapest-river-cruises/he.json",
   "seen": 1
  },
