   "source": "listicle file best-budapest-river-cruises/he.json",
   "seen": 2
  },
  "<strong>1 drink included: champagne, wine, beer, a soft drink or mineral water.</strong> In summer you get a free lemonade on top. More drinks at the bar on board.": {
   "source": "listicle file best-budapest-river-cruises/he.json",
   "seen": 1
  },
  "Calm sightseeing": {
   "source": "listicle file best-budapest-river-cruises/he.json",
   "seen": 1
  },
  "<strong>Seated sightseeing with a 30-language audio guide on headsets, not a party boat.</strong> Open-air seats at the back of the top deck, heated cabin below. The welcome drink can be a soft drink or water, so non-drinkers pay for nothing they skip.": {
   "source": "listicle file best-budapest-river-cruises/he.json",
   "seen": 1
  },
  "<strong>Open-air seats at the back of the top deck.</strong> Heated cabin below in winter.": {
